<title>BELGIUM: CYCLING-GHENT SIX-DAY FINAL POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-GHENT SIX-DAY FINAL POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>GHENT, Belgium 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final positions after the sixth day of the Ghent six-day cycling race on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. Bruno Risi/Kurt Betschart (Switzerland)    465 points</p>
<p> 2. Etienne De Wilde/Adriano Baffi (Belgium/Italy) 450</p>
<p>One lap behind:</p>
<p> 3. Andreas Kappes/Carsten Wolf (Germany)	    490</p>
<p>Two laps behind:</p>
<p> 4. Jens Veggerby/Jimmi Madsen (Denmark)	     391</p>
<p> 5. Silvio Martinello/Marco Villa (Italy)	    363</p>
<p>Seven laps behind:</p>
<p>6. Matthew Gilmore/Jakob Piil Storm (Australia/Denmark)</p>
<p>								   318</p>
</text>
